      "note": "Farmacia Emergencias (farmaciaemergencias.com.mx) serves a broken SSL certificate chain (self-signed intermediate) - confirmed via live investigation, not a configuration mistake on our end. Net::HTTP refuses to connect at all without disabling verification. Accepted deliberately: this fetches only public product/price listings (no credentials, no sensitive data sent or received), and this is the only crawler where verification is disabled - every other crawler in the codebase verifies certificates normally. Revisit if the site ever fixes its certificate."
